              <p>Il <b>lock</b> è quello condiviso delle pagine di struttura: una persona alla volta.</p>",
            @"<p>The <b>Neighbours</b> page (<code>/services/vsop/admin/neighbours</code>) holds the <b>pairs</b>
               Italian ACC ↔ foreign ACC the <b>vLOAs</b> are born from. The countries to draw from live in
               <code>Neighbours:CountryIds</code>; sectors are neighbours when the minimum distance between
               their edges is below <code>AdjacencyThresholdNm</code>. Non-adjacent pairs are not saved.</p>
              <ul>
                <li><b>Import &amp; compute</b> fetches the ACCs of the neighbouring countries and recomputes
