                <li><b>Pair by hand</b> is for when IVAO does not provide the foreign ACC at all.</li>
              </ul>
              <p>The <b>lock</b> is the shared one of the structure pages: one person at a time.</p>"),

        new Sec("admin-audit", "clock",
            @"<p>Il <b>registro</b> (<code>/services/vsop/admin/audit</code>) elenca gli <b>atti amministrativi</b>:
               pubblicazioni, bozze scartate, documenti eliminati o nascosti, permessi concessi e revocati,
